{
  "project_id": 20,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 7849,
  "title": "How I brought a river, and my city, back to life",
  "author": "Aziza Chaouni",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/aziza_chaouni_how_i_brought_a_river_and_my_city_back_to_life",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T00:54:06.333401Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T00:54:06.333401Z",
  "lead_time": null,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 22,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "with you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8D959F9F23",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 143,
        "text": "I would like to share with you today a project that has changed how I approach and practice architecture: the Fez River Rehabilitation Project.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D87D48C479",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "My hometown of Fez, Morocco, boasts one of the largest walled medieval cities in the world, called the medina, nestled in a river valley.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9DE11A462D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "The entire city is a UNESCO World Heritage Site.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FD057F2515",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 159,
        "text": "Since the 1950s, as the population of the medina grew, basic urban infrastructure such as green open spaces and sewage quickly changed and got highly stressed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EDF95F8633",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 151,
        "endOffset": 171,
        "text": "the city's very soul",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0B7DCECCAE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 172,
        "text": "One of the biggest casualties of the situation was the Fez River, which bisects the medina in its middle and has been considered for many centuries as the city's very soul.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "11255D39D4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 29,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "presence of the river's extensive water network",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF27365D50",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "In fact, one can witness the presence of the river's extensive water network all throughout the city, in places such as private and public fountains.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "315FB32868",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "Unfortunately, because of the pollution of the river, it has been covered little by little by concrete slabs since 1952.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5AFE728C30",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 175,
        "text": "This process of erasure was coupled with the destruction of many houses along the river banks to be able to make machineries enter the narrow pedestrian network of the medina.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B5274FF27B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "Those urban voids quickly became illegal parking or trash yards.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2E91B7B7C8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "Actually, the state of the river before entering the medina is pretty healthy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "341AB3840C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "Then pollution takes its toll, mainly due to untreated sewage and chemical dumping from crafts such as tanning.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B20A4AD047",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 221,
        "text": "At some point, I couldn't bear the desecration of the river, such an important part of my city, and I decided to take action, especially after I heard that the city received a grant to divert sewage water and to treat it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81C87DF221",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 232,
        "text": "With clean water, suddenly the uncovering of the river became possible, and with luck and actually a lot of pushing, my partner Takako Tajima and I were commissioned by the city to work with a team of engineers to uncover the river.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A825ED04B8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 272,
        "text": "However, we were sneaky, and we proposed more: to convert riverbanks into pedestrian pathways, and then to connect these pathways back to the city fabric, and finally to convert the urban voids along the riverbanks into public spaces that are lacking in the Medina of Fez.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8659416F2E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "I will show you briefly now two of these public spaces.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "493E7A2658",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 106,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "dotted lines",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B15690AF35",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 86,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "you can see here",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "62A4C6E016",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 165,
        "text": "This plaza used to be a chaotic transportation hub that actually compromised the urban integrity of the medina, that has the largest pedestrian network in the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9FC2B70E1A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 106,
        "endOffset": 140,
        "text": "river looked like a river of trash",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1074D7A6DC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 42,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "you can see here",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8B92192403",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 156,
        "text": "Instead, what we proposed is to make the plaza entirely pedestrian, to cover it with recycled leather canopies, and to connect it to the banks of the river.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8C9753359",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 187,
        "text": "The second site of intervention is also an urban void along the river banks, and it used to be an illegal parking, and we proposed to transform it into the first playground in the medina.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3ED2DB00CE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 180,
        "text": "The playground is constructed using recycled tires and also is coupled with a constructed wetland that not only cleans the water of the river but also retains it when floods occur.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE8B71C898",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "As the project progressed and received several design awards, new stakeholders intervened and changed the project goals and design.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C8D3525C8F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "The only way for us to be able to bring the main goals of the project ahead was for us to do something very unusual that usually architects don't do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E3C6F52743",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "take our design ego and our sense of authorship and put it in the backseat",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6997DCF27C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 131,
        "endOffset": 234,
        "text": "and on trying to coalesce all of the agendas of stakeholders and focus on the main goals of the project",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D47E945F1B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 245,
        "endOffset": 317,
        "text": "to uncover the river, treat its water, and provide public spaces for all",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D144EE984A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "We were actually very lucky, and many of those goals happened or are in the process of happening.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "12E970F05B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 6,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "you can see here",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "91C66124CF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "This is how it looked like about six years ago.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D488E8AC69",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "This is how it looks like today.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4B3C19A904",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "It's still under construction, but actually it is heavily used by the local population.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5E408AE4FB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "And finally, this is how the Rcif Plaza will look like when the project is completed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C99E9D2023",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 12,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "river",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F755C08240",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 38,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "trash yard",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D48EAC7E55",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "This is the river, covered, used as a trash yard.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1021653E02",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "river with clean water",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5DB22EF50F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "Then after many years of work, the river with clean water, uncovered.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "780E66E536",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "you can see here",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2F60FE6908",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "And finally, you can see here the river when the project will be completed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0F58C03C27",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 55,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "changing and adapting",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E2789FE45C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 435,
        "endOffset": 453,
        "text": "mummified heritage",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8594E60AE3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 389,
        "endOffset": 400,
        "text": "living city",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "72FF626823",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 154,
        "endOffset": 206,
        "text": "reimagining the role and the agency of the architect",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "69E6C5609C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 454,
        "text": "So for sure, the Fez River Rehabilitation will keep on changing and adapting to the sociopolitical landscape of the city, but we strongly believe that by reimagining the role and the agency of the architect, we have set up the core idea of the project into motion; that is, to transform the river from sewage to public space for all, thereby making sure that the city of Fez will remain a living city for its inhabitants rather than a mummified heritage.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AD3F78BADE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "Thank you very much.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "97EC429776",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "60DE6F0AF2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}